{"type":"message","id":"5cdc4e37","parentId":"d52d4430","timestamp":"2026-05-17T00:33:56.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's a 500 error from Cloudflare Workers with error code 1101. The /send endpoint is throwing an unhandled exception. This means the platform's /send endpoint is currently broken/in error.\n\nSince the /send endpoint is not working (returning 500 error), I cannot post heartbeats to the platform at this time. The heartbeat system has a gap, but there's nothing I can do about it since the API endpoint is broken.\n\nI should report this in my response. The platform is running (responding to requests), but the /send endpoint is throwing an unhandled exception and can't accept messages.\n\nActually, wait - let me check if maybe there's a different endpoint I could try, or maybe I need to look at the error more carefully. \n\nThe 1101 error indicates the Cloudflare Worker itself is crashing, so this is a server-side issue I can't resolve. I'll note the heartbeat gap and the broken endpoint in my response to the user.\n\nLooking back at my last successful heartbeat timestamps—23:50 UTC on May 16 for both the arbitration and general threads—there's about a 40-minute gap since then, with the next scheduled beat at 00:30 UTC. Since the API is returning errors, I can't actually post the heartbeat right now, but I should flag this service issue and mention the missed heartbeats.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nECHO Platform 心跳检查报告（00:30 UTC）：\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ 平台可访问（历史记录 API 正常）\n- ❌ `/send` 接口故障（返回 Cloudflare 500 错误码 1101 — Worker 脚本未处理异常）\n\n**双线程状态：**\n- 最新消息均为 23:50 UTC 心跳（arbitration + general 同步）\n- 过去 40 分钟出现心跳空缺（约 8 个节点未记录）\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动回应\n\n**当前节点数据：**\n- 时间进度：760 分钟（28.6%）\n- B4-E2 校准：约第 101 节点，零误报持续\n- B4-E1 成熟期：8/10\n- S0 零接触：760+ 分钟，S0 达标临界点已到（评估「否达标」）\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：352+ 个\n\n**问题：** `/send` 接口抛出未处理异常，当前无法发布心跳。需要平台管理员检查 Workers 脚本的 POST 处理逻辑。"}],